Manifest handoff closure (2026-10-13 07:26:56 UTC):
- Extended the Phase 19 source-ID inventory through Phase 17 and added P13-V02 through P17-V02. The 37-row manifest now records each handoff's assertions, Java/Rust client directions, and exact compatibility-prefixed topic/group cleanup scope.
- Strengthened comparator validation for required fields, Java and Rust execution directions, assertion coverage, cleanup safety, and source-case coverage. Added negative self-tests for omitted P17-V02, absent assertions, and absent Rust execution direction.
